  "question": {
    "text": "A satellite revolving around a planet in stationary orbit has time period 6 hours. The mass of planet is one-fourth the mass of earth. The radius orbit of planet is :\n$\\left(\\right.$ Given $=$ Radius of geo-stationary orbit for earth is $4.2 \\times 10^4 \\mathrm{~km}$ )",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
